# Integer16 subtraction in both operand orders

Verifies int16 subtraction in both operand orders through the complete CLI
pipeline.

>>> source
left: int16 = 30000
right: int16 = 12345

// Verifies subtraction with the larger operand first.
forward_diff: int16 = left - right
print(forward_diff)

// Verifies subtraction with the smaller operand first.
reversed_diff: int16 = right - left
print(reversed_diff)

<<< stdout
17655
-17655

<<< stderr
